Nat</a> := <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.size\">size</a></span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The index of the first element at or after `start` that satisfies `p`, with a proof that it is in\nbounds.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Array.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.findFinIdx?","kind":"def","line":108,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.findFinIdx?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Array.lean#L108-L120"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Array.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.propagateMark\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">propagateMark</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `b`, marked as linear if `a` is marked. Like `markLinear`, marking copies `b` first if it is\nshared. Logically this is `b`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Array.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.propagateMark","kind":"def","line":99,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.propagateMark","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Array.lean#L99-L104"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Array.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.markLinear\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">markLinear</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Marks `a` as linear, a debugging aid: if a marked array is ever copied because it is shared when\nit needs to be exclusive, as before an in-place write, the runtime panics. The mark goes on an\nexclusive array, so if `a` is shared it is copied first and the copy is marked. Logically this is\nthe identity.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Array.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.markLinear","kind":"def","line":90,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.markLinear","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/ISize/Array.lean#L90-L97"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Array.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.extract\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">extract</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">start </span><span class=\"fn\">stop</span> : <a href=\"./In